---
title: Complete Request Lifecycle - Enterprise RAG
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as SRE User
    participant UI as Client / Streamlit
    participant API as FastAPI /query
    participant Guard as Security Pipeline
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant Router as Intent Router
    participant RAG as RAG Service
    participant SQL as SQL Service
    participant LLM as OpenAI
    participant DB as Postgres / Qdrant / Redis

    User->>UI: Ask Kubernetes or ops question
    UI->>API: POST /query with Bearer JWT
    API->>Guard: validate, authenticate, rate limit, budget
    Guard->>Guard: restructure input, scan prompt, redact PII
    Guard->>Graph: invoke graph with question, user_id, flags
    Graph->>Router: classify intent
    Router-->>Graph: rag, sql, or hybrid

    alt RAG question
        Graph->>RAG: retrieve and generate
        RAG->>DB: embedding cache and Qdrant search
        RAG->>LLM: answer with spotlighted context
        LLM-->>RAG: grounded answer
    else SQL question
        Graph->>SQL: generate SQL from schema
        SQL->>LLM: produce SELECT query JSON
        SQL-->>Graph: SQL + explanation
        Graph-->>API: interrupt with pending_sql
        API-->>UI: ask user for approval
    else Hybrid question
        Graph->>RAG: retrieve docs
        Graph->>SQL: generate SQL
        Graph-->>API: interrupt with pending_sql
    end

    API->>Guard: output moderation and redaction
    Guard-->>UI: ChatResponse
